    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like the turns? Like the high speed maneuvers in Spa or Glen? FP Racer is all about the turns. It's the feeling of control at a God-like level. <br><br>Immerse yourself in the world of FP Racer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524110/extras/c1c71e48242138d22fc46c07386864b9.poster.avif?t=1743332599\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524110/extras/c1c71e48242138d22fc46c07386864b9.webm?t=1743332599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524110/extras/c1c71e48242138d22fc46c07386864b9.mp4?t=1743332599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FP Racer is a short solo racing experience. It has 9 levels. There is a leaderboard for each level. <br>It is like a runner with car handling controls. There is no AI or competitive element except for the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has a minimalistic design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524110/extras/479a03416beec92ef101ea5780b86e82.avif?t=1743332599\" width=800 height=424 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like the turns? Like the high speed maneuvers in Spa or Glen? FP Racer is all about the turns. It's the feeling of control at a God-like level. <br><br>Immerse yourself in the world of FP Racer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524110/extras/c1c71e48242138d22fc46c07386864b9.poster.avif?t=1743332599\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524110/extras/c1c71e48242138d22fc46c07386864b9.webm?t=1743332599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524110/extras/c1c71e48242138d22fc46c07386864b9.mp4?t=1743332599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FP Racer is a short solo racing experience. It has 9 levels. There is a leaderboard for each level. <br>It is like a runner with car handling controls. There is no AI or competitive element except for the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has a minimalistic design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524110/extras/479a03416beec92ef101ea5780b86e82.avif?t=1743332599\" width=800 height=424 /></span></p>",
